WEBVTT

00:00:18.210 --> 00:00:19.620
Honoka, let's go.

00:00:19.620 --> 00:00:20.460
Right!

00:00:20.460 --> 00:00:21.500
Honoka? Shizuku?

00:00:21.500 --> 00:00:23.540
Huh? Wh-What?

00:00:23.540 --> 00:00:26.880
You seem to be in quite a rush.
Do you have someplace to be?

00:00:26.880 --> 00:00:29.090
Y-Yes, you could say that.

00:00:30.340 --> 00:00:31.640
See you later!

00:00:31.640 --> 00:00:32.760
Oh...

00:00:35.100 --> 00:00:38.980
Sorry, Miyuki, but we're doing this
for you and Tatsuya!

00:00:39.480 --> 00:00:42.520
I'm sorry. I wasn't able
to learn anything from them.

00:00:42.520 --> 00:00:45.610
There's no reason for you to apologize.

00:00:45.610 --> 00:00:48.150
I do believe they're hiding something,

00:00:48.150 --> 00:00:50.990
but I can't very well question them
without any proof.

00:00:50.990 --> 00:00:53.570
But I'm also worried about those two.

00:00:53.570 --> 00:00:55.120
It's all right.

00:00:56.410 --> 00:01:00.830
Those two are your friends, right?
They'll open up to you eventually.

00:01:00.830 --> 00:01:02.120
Friends?

00:01:02.120 --> 00:01:03.830
Shiba...

00:01:04.840 --> 00:01:06.090
Hello.

00:01:06.090 --> 00:01:09.420
Or should I say "nice to meet you"?

00:01:09.420 --> 00:01:14.010
I guess so.
Nice to meet you, Ms. Mibu, was it?

00:01:14.010 --> 00:01:18.140
I'm Sayaka Mibu.
In Class E. The same as you.

00:01:18.140 --> 00:01:21.190
Thank you for saving me at the dojo.

00:01:23.650 --> 00:01:28.230
I'd like to thank you properly
as well as talk to you about something.

00:01:28.230 --> 00:01:30.990
Would you mind hanging out
with me for a bit?

00:03:19.430 --> 00:03:24.390
I wonder what my brother
talked about with Ms. Mibu.

00:03:26.100 --> 00:03:30.360
U-U-Um...
Ever since the first moment we met...

00:03:30.360 --> 00:03:32.150
I've been in...

00:03:32.150 --> 00:03:35.240
l-l-lo...

00:03:35.240 --> 00:03:38.450
Wh-What are you thinking, Miyuki?

00:03:38.450 --> 00:03:40.410
Well, my brother is good-looking,

00:03:40.410 --> 00:03:44.240
so it's no wonder
that women are attracted to him.

00:03:45.450 --> 00:03:49.420
But when we're at home,
I want him to belong only to me.

00:03:49.420 --> 00:03:50.960
To make that happen...

00:03:52.000 --> 00:03:56.380
I must become the kind of sister
who's worthy of him!

00:03:56.380 --> 00:03:58.800
But...

00:03:58.800 --> 00:04:02.180
I do want to make his heart stop.
Just a little.

00:04:02.180 --> 00:04:05.310
Is this a bit cliché?

00:04:05.310 --> 00:04:07.350
Now, this certainly won't do!

00:04:09.650 --> 00:04:12.230
Like we're at a highland resort!

00:04:14.270 --> 00:04:17.360
This isn't the kind of outfit
you should be wearing at home, right?

00:04:17.360 --> 00:04:19.860
It's kind of like the energetic Erika!

00:04:21.280 --> 00:04:22.910
My stomach!

00:04:29.290 --> 00:04:32.210
Now, this should give him a jolt, right?

00:04:32.210 --> 00:04:34.920
Thank you for waiting, Brother.

00:04:34.920 --> 00:04:37.760
What's going on?
It's not even New Year's.

00:04:37.760 --> 00:04:39.510
Oh, but...

00:04:39.510 --> 00:04:43.430
just getting to be near you, Brother...

00:04:43.430 --> 00:04:46.560
makes every day feel like a holiday!

00:04:48.100 --> 00:04:50.940
Now, that's too heavy!

00:04:50.940 --> 00:04:52.100
That's no good!

00:04:52.100 --> 00:04:56.320
I'd only be subjecting my brother to
unnecessary psychological pressure!

00:04:56.320 --> 00:04:58.740
Oh, dear!

00:04:58.740 --> 00:05:00.700
What am I supposed to do?

00:05:05.450 --> 00:05:07.540
What happened? Are you okay?

00:05:10.120 --> 00:05:11.710
Miyuki...

00:05:17.210 --> 00:05:19.840
STUDENT COUNCIL OFFICE

00:05:17.840 --> 00:05:20.050
So? Tatsuya?

00:05:20.050 --> 00:05:25.850
Is it true that you verbally abused second
year Sayaka Mibu yesterday at a café?

00:05:25.850 --> 00:05:27.180
Verbally abused?

00:05:27.180 --> 00:05:29.520
Details! More details, Mari!

00:05:29.520 --> 00:05:30.730
Those are false accusations.

00:05:30.730 --> 00:05:32.730
Oh? Is that so?

00:05:32.730 --> 00:05:37.780
I have witnesses who observed Mibu
blushing red and looking embarrassed.

00:05:37.780 --> 00:05:39.570
Verbal abuse...

00:05:43.410 --> 00:05:45.200
Brother...

00:05:45.200 --> 00:05:48.200
What in the world happened
between you and Ms. Mibu?

00:05:48.200 --> 00:05:50.620
Freezing Magic without a CAD!

00:05:50.620 --> 00:05:53.580
Your interference power
must be unusually potent.

00:05:53.580 --> 00:05:57.090
Sorry! I went a little overboard!

00:05:57.090 --> 00:06:02.970
Calm down, Miyuki.
I'll explain everything to you.

00:06:02.970 --> 00:06:05.090
I'm so sorry.

00:06:05.930 --> 00:06:12.640
Ms. Mibu asked to talk to me, partly so she
could thank me for the incident at the dojo.

00:06:12.640 --> 00:06:17.900
But from what I heard from her, she's seriously
biased against the Disciplinary Committee.

00:06:17.900 --> 00:06:19.530
The Disciplinary Committee?

00:06:19.530 --> 00:06:22.070
She said that the reason
you cracked down so hard that day

00:06:22.070 --> 00:06:25.360
was to score points
for the Disciplinary Committee.

00:06:25.360 --> 00:06:29.990
I see. She really has it in for us.

00:06:29.990 --> 00:06:33.210
I told her she was mistaken
about us scoring points...

00:06:33.210 --> 00:06:36.380
but I couldn't get her to believe me.

00:06:36.380 --> 00:06:41.800
For students disgruntled with the status quo,
a conspiracy seems reassuring, after all.

00:06:41.800 --> 00:06:44.380
Even if it's totally false.

00:06:46.010 --> 00:06:47.680
Am I imagining things?

00:06:47.680 --> 00:06:51.470
What she just said...
It's like she knows something.

00:06:54.640 --> 00:06:56.400
She also voiced...

00:06:56.400 --> 00:06:59.860
her strong displeasure with the way
students are discriminated against

00:06:59.860 --> 00:07:02.480
on the basis of their magic grades.

00:07:03.740 --> 00:07:06.860
Non-magic-oriented clubs
are being discriminated against.

00:07:06.860 --> 00:07:11.120
So, they've united and are planning
to present their argument to the school

00:07:11.120 --> 00:07:14.200
that magic isn't everything.

00:07:14.200 --> 00:07:16.170
But...

00:07:16.170 --> 00:07:19.840
I have a question for you,
Upperclasswoman.

00:07:19.840 --> 00:07:23.670
You're going to present your argument
to the school. And then what?

00:07:23.670 --> 00:07:25.720
What?

00:07:25.720 --> 00:07:30.550
I didn't get a chance to hear her answer,
but that comment about scoring points...

00:07:30.550 --> 00:07:33.850
She seems to be wildly delusional.

00:07:33.850 --> 00:07:36.060
I agree.

00:07:36.060 --> 00:07:40.860
Either delusional or else she's being
manipulated by someone else.

00:07:40.860 --> 00:07:43.860
Ms. Watanabe seems uncomfortable, too.

00:07:43.860 --> 00:07:48.240
No question about it! The Student Council
definitely knows something!

00:07:48.240 --> 00:07:53.830
And Ms. Nakajo is feigning ignorance,
but actually...

00:07:53.830 --> 00:07:56.370
By "someone else," do you mean...

00:07:56.370 --> 00:07:58.500
an organization like Blanche for example?

00:07:58.500 --> 00:07:59.540
What?

00:07:59.540 --> 00:08:01.420
How do you know that name?

00:08:01.420 --> 00:08:02.750
"Blanche"?

00:08:02.750 --> 00:08:04.710
Um...

00:08:04.710 --> 00:08:07.510
She doesn't know!

00:08:07.510 --> 00:08:10.140
It doesn't look like it'll do any good
keeping it from you.

00:08:10.140 --> 00:08:11.600
This school has been infiltrated

00:08:11.600 --> 00:08:16.060
by the international anti-magic
political organization, Blanche.

00:08:18.980 --> 00:08:21.730
Brother, you knew!

00:08:21.730 --> 00:08:26.860
What's been happening at this school and
the fact that you were attacked by Blanche...

00:08:26.860 --> 00:08:29.820
But he didn't say a word that day.

00:08:29.820 --> 00:08:32.370
He wouldn't talk to me.

00:08:32.370 --> 00:08:36.040
The reason is probably...

00:08:37.750 --> 00:08:42.920
My brother's always cherished me above all.

00:08:42.920 --> 00:08:45.170
And because of that...

00:08:45.170 --> 00:08:50.010
he's always been willing
to get hurt himself.

00:08:50.010 --> 00:08:55.850
Sorry. I can see that not telling you
ended up worrying you more.

00:08:55.850 --> 00:08:59.230
Cabinet name "Blanche," open.

00:09:00.560 --> 00:09:04.730
The international anti-magic political
organization, Blanche, is behind this.

00:09:04.730 --> 00:09:07.900
On the surface,
they help out grassroots campaigns,

00:09:07.900 --> 00:09:10.110
but underneath it all,
they're bona fide terrorists.

00:09:10.110 --> 00:09:12.360
Advocating the end of discrimination,

00:09:12.360 --> 00:09:17.040
they decry the fact that competent
magicians receive superior social standing.

00:09:17.040 --> 00:09:21.040
Those people attacked you and First High?

00:09:21.040 --> 00:09:24.960
Those unable to wield magic
and those with inferior magic skills

00:09:24.960 --> 00:09:30.920
wrap their jealousy and realities in an idea
called "equality," and toy with weak souls.

00:09:30.920 --> 00:09:32.890
That's Blanche's modus operandi.

00:09:32.890 --> 00:09:36.390
Then, the reason they targeted First High...

00:09:36.390 --> 00:09:38.890
Just because they have
inferior grades in magic,

00:09:38.890 --> 00:09:42.060
they're looked down upon as "Weeds"
and regarded with contempt.

00:09:42.060 --> 00:09:47.020
Right now, that's par for the course at First
High which is truly a microcosm of society.

00:09:47.020 --> 00:09:49.780
Blanche is taking advantage of that.

00:09:51.700 --> 00:09:54.820
Good or bad, magic is a power.

00:09:54.820 --> 00:09:57.370
Just like financial or military might.

00:09:57.370 --> 00:10:02.710
There's no way that magical might can
expand in a society that rejects magic.

00:10:02.710 --> 00:10:06.790
In other words, by rejecting magic,
they mean to make it obsolete,

00:10:06.790 --> 00:10:09.590
and ultimately drain
the country of its power.

00:10:09.590 --> 00:10:12.760
Is that Blanche's final goal?

00:10:12.760 --> 00:10:14.340
Probably.

00:10:14.340 --> 00:10:19.010
And there's no way that
the Ten Master Clans will ignore them.

00:10:19.010 --> 00:10:22.100
Especially the Yotsuba Family.

00:10:22.100 --> 00:10:26.520
Worst case, they'll launch a purge,
and we could be dragged into all that.

00:10:26.520 --> 00:10:31.150
No, I guess "be dragged into it"
is an understatement.

00:10:31.150 --> 00:10:33.070
The Yotsuba Family...

00:10:33.070 --> 00:10:34.450
Our aunt...

00:10:34.450 --> 00:10:39.240
It's possible that they might
use us as their pawns.

00:10:39.240 --> 00:10:43.410
Right before the eyes of the other Ten Master
Clans, the Saegusa and Jumonji families.

00:10:43.410 --> 00:10:46.040
If that were to happen...

00:10:47.250 --> 00:10:52.590
We couldn't remain
high school students, could we?

00:10:52.590 --> 00:10:56.010
We'd have to go back to being Yotsubas.

00:11:02.140 --> 00:11:04.270
You don't have to be afraid.

00:11:04.270 --> 00:11:10.650
No matter how many come after us,
I won't let anyone destroy our daily lives.

00:11:10.650 --> 00:11:12.280
Brother...

00:11:12.280 --> 00:11:15.070
If push comes to shove,

00:11:15.070 --> 00:11:18.950
I'll take care of it
before the Yotsubas can make a move.

00:11:23.330 --> 00:11:26.170
Thank you very much.

00:11:26.170 --> 00:11:29.420
This daily life you're trying to protect

00:11:29.420 --> 00:11:32.670
is also something
that I'd like to protect.

00:11:32.670 --> 00:11:35.630
And when the time comes, I, too...

00:11:47.520 --> 00:11:50.560
The three of us may have been born
on different days...

00:11:50.560 --> 00:11:52.070
But we'll be together in death!

00:11:52.070 --> 00:11:53.690
No, that's not right.

00:11:53.690 --> 00:11:56.570
The captain of the Kendo Club, Kinoe Tsukasa.

00:11:56.570 --> 00:12:00.030
Although there's no question
that he's the one who attacked Tatsuya...

00:12:00.030 --> 00:12:02.490
...he still hasn't shown his true colors.

00:12:03.160 --> 00:12:07.620
But today of all days, we're going to get
our hands on irrefutable proof!

00:12:07.620 --> 00:12:09.580
Girls' Detective Club...

00:12:09.580 --> 00:12:11.210
Mobilize!

00:12:15.800 --> 00:12:17.550
We're acting more and more like stalkers.

00:12:17.550 --> 00:12:19.470
No, we're not!

00:12:24.560 --> 00:12:26.180
Isn't that...

00:12:31.690 --> 00:12:35.190
We'll be out of the school's
surveillance camera range soon.

00:12:35.190 --> 00:12:37.400
I wonder if his home is this way.

00:12:37.400 --> 00:12:41.320
I saw him coming to school from the
station this morning, so I don't think so.

00:12:41.320 --> 00:12:44.620
Very suspicious!
There's got to be something going on!

00:12:44.620 --> 00:12:49.420
But you know what...
I'm a little worried now.

00:12:49.420 --> 00:12:51.130
Actually, so am I.

00:12:51.130 --> 00:12:52.710
Huh? You are?

00:12:52.710 --> 00:12:56.590
Needless to say,
our safety isn't guaranteed.

00:12:56.590 --> 00:12:58.800
But the three of us together...

00:13:04.260 --> 00:13:07.020
I've guided them to the specified spot.

00:13:10.100 --> 00:13:11.690
He's onto us!

00:13:11.690 --> 00:13:13.650
Not sure about this,
but we're going after him!

00:13:17.150 --> 00:13:19.280
Huh? He's gone!

00:13:42.340 --> 00:13:45.350
Wh-Who are you?

00:13:48.470 --> 00:13:50.980
You two, run on my signal.

00:13:50.980 --> 00:13:52.440
Okay.

00:13:53.690 --> 00:13:56.860
Huh! Skulking around us like that...

00:13:56.860 --> 00:13:59.900
You know what happens
to mice that try to thwart us?

00:13:59.900 --> 00:14:01.400
Go!

00:14:03.360 --> 00:14:04.870
Don't let them get away!

00:14:06.990 --> 00:14:09.160
Thinking we're just high school girls...

00:14:09.160 --> 00:14:10.950
Don't underestimate us!

00:14:13.500 --> 00:14:14.960
Take this!

00:14:18.210 --> 00:14:21.550
That's called "a defensive preemptive strike"!

00:14:22.380 --> 00:14:23.930
Me, too!

00:14:25.640 --> 00:14:27.260
My eyes!

00:14:27.260 --> 00:14:28.810
You damn monsters!

00:14:29.930 --> 00:14:32.020
See how you like this!

00:14:37.690 --> 00:14:41.940
Wh-What's this? It feels
like my head's about to split!

00:14:43.490 --> 00:14:45.200
Are you in agony?

00:14:45.200 --> 00:14:48.740
As long as we can keep
this Antinite-fueled Cast Jamming going...

00:14:48.740 --> 00:14:52.250
you won't be able to use any magic at all!

00:14:52.250 --> 00:14:56.080
Anyone who tries to thwart our plans
can just disappear.

00:14:56.080 --> 00:15:00.710
This world doesn't need any magicians!

00:15:00.710 --> 00:15:03.170
Step away from the students
from my school.

00:15:12.310 --> 00:15:13.930
When did this happen?

00:15:13.930 --> 00:15:15.730
Did she do this?

00:15:15.730 --> 00:15:16.650
No way!

00:15:16.650 --> 00:15:20.440
She can't possibly use magic
with all this Cast Jamming going on!

00:15:20.440 --> 00:15:23.150
Hey! Raise the output levels!

00:15:23.150 --> 00:15:24.450
It's futile.

00:15:24.450 --> 00:15:28.200
Cast Jamming by non-magicians
has zero effect.

00:15:28.200 --> 00:15:30.160
Dammit, you're just bluffing!

00:15:30.160 --> 00:15:31.870
Take this!

00:15:43.960 --> 00:15:45.840
You're safe now.

00:15:46.510 --> 00:15:48.470
Miyuki!

00:15:51.760 --> 00:15:53.680
How did you get involved in such a thing?

00:15:53.680 --> 00:15:55.350
This is...

00:15:55.350 --> 00:15:59.730
We saw your brother
get attacked by someone.

00:15:59.730 --> 00:16:00.560
What?

00:16:00.560 --> 00:16:04.280
And we thought
you'd only worry if we told you.

00:16:04.280 --> 00:16:08.950
So, the three of us tried to catch
the attacker ourselves, but...

00:16:08.950 --> 00:16:10.700
We're sorry.

00:16:13.450 --> 00:16:14.870
Honoka...

00:16:14.870 --> 00:16:16.830
Shizuku, Eimi...

00:16:16.830 --> 00:16:20.210
Thank you! For doing this for my brother.

00:16:20.210 --> 00:16:24.380
I'm truly glad that we're friends!

00:16:25.960 --> 00:16:28.760
You think it's okay to leave it all to Miyuki?

00:16:28.760 --> 00:16:31.010
She said she didn't want it
to turn into a whole big deal.

00:16:31.010 --> 00:16:34.470
And those guys are no match for Miyuki.

00:16:34.470 --> 00:16:36.810
Wasn't she amazing, though?

00:16:36.810 --> 00:16:40.150
That Cast Jamming had
no effect on her at all!

00:16:40.150 --> 00:16:43.230
Her interference power
is just off the charts!

00:16:43.230 --> 00:16:44.270
Yeah!

00:16:44.270 --> 00:16:46.570
She really was unbelievable.

00:16:46.570 --> 00:16:48.200
Like a member of the Ten Master Clans.

00:16:48.950 --> 00:16:51.070
Huh? Did you say something?

00:16:51.070 --> 00:16:53.780
No, nothing.

00:16:53.780 --> 00:16:58.120
I'm so sorry to trouble you, Mr. Yakumo.

00:16:58.120 --> 00:17:01.630
Well, it's rare for you to give me a call.

00:17:01.630 --> 00:17:08.090
So, you want me to clean up this mess and
interrogate these thugs before the police can?

00:17:08.090 --> 00:17:11.390
You can see right through me,
can't you, Mr. Yakumo?

00:17:11.390 --> 00:17:13.890
Well, I am a ninja.

00:17:13.890 --> 00:17:16.850
Or at least I'd like to say that I am.
But I'm not really.

00:17:16.850 --> 00:17:22.730
After all, I can't find a shred of information
on you siblings, try as I might.

00:17:22.730 --> 00:17:27.070
Damn monsters! You magicians
will end up destroying the world one day!

00:17:27.070 --> 00:17:29.530
But we're going to stop you,
no matter what!

00:17:29.530 --> 00:17:30.950
Oh dear...

00:17:30.950 --> 00:17:32.910
They're like fanatics.

00:17:32.910 --> 00:17:34.780
My, my...

00:17:34.780 --> 00:17:37.490
That's quite defiant of you.

00:17:37.490 --> 00:17:39.000
Are you sure about this?

00:17:39.000 --> 00:17:42.170
Speaking to a monster like that?

00:17:45.710 --> 00:17:50.220
S-Stay away from me, monster!

00:17:50.220 --> 00:17:52.630
It looks like that was a little too potent.

00:17:52.760 --> 00:17:57.220
I thought Mental Interference Magic
was your forte.

00:17:57.220 --> 00:18:02.640
Since I have no chance to practice,
I didn't hold back enough.

00:18:02.640 --> 00:18:05.310
You can leave the rest to me.

00:18:05.310 --> 00:18:08.900
There's no sugarcoating
such things, after all.

00:18:08.900 --> 00:18:12.570
I never meant to be
the only innocent one in all this.

00:18:12.570 --> 00:18:17.160
But I'm sure that Tatsuya thinks
the exact opposite.

00:18:17.160 --> 00:18:21.710
M-Mr. Yakumo, that's not fair
to bring up my brother's name!

00:18:24.170 --> 00:18:28.550
Mr. Yakumo, there's one more thing
I'd like you to look into for me.

00:18:28.550 --> 00:18:29.550
Hmm?

00:18:29.550 --> 00:18:32.760
About the perpetrator
who attacked my brother...

00:18:32.760 --> 00:18:35.640
A student named Kinoe Tsukasa.

00:18:35.640 --> 00:18:38.220
So, those four never returned?

00:18:38.220 --> 00:18:40.930
No. I think they might've been captured.

00:18:40.930 --> 00:18:42.520
By the police?

00:18:42.520 --> 00:18:46.060
But we would've heard about it by now.

00:18:46.060 --> 00:18:49.360
Brother, I'm sorry.
All of that for me...

00:18:49.360 --> 00:18:50.440
Kinoe...

00:18:50.440 --> 00:18:53.240
It's not your fault.

00:18:53.240 --> 00:18:56.410
But it might be about time to try something

00:18:56.410 --> 00:19:00.580
other than advancing our reforms
through amicable means like talks.

00:19:00.580 --> 00:19:02.120
Then, it's time?

00:19:02.120 --> 00:19:05.290
Rally our comrades at First High.

00:19:07.080 --> 00:19:12.920
APRIL 21, 2095 - AFTER SCHOOL

00:19:07.250 --> 00:19:08.670
Attention, all students!

00:19:08.670 --> 00:19:14.260
We are a coalition seeking to abolish
discrimination within the school!

00:19:14.260 --> 00:19:15.720
As you all know,

00:19:15.720 --> 00:19:20.140
discrimination based on magic
grades exists at this school!

00:19:20.140 --> 00:19:22.810
Discrimination? Who's this moron?

00:19:22.810 --> 00:19:26.100
Blanche made their move
sooner than we thought.

00:19:26.100 --> 00:19:28.480
We must hurry or else...

00:19:28.480 --> 00:19:31.820
We are students of magic
who aspire to become magicians.

00:19:30.650 --> 00:19:31.820
Tell 'em!

00:19:31.820 --> 00:19:34.570
But at the same time,
we are also high school students!

00:19:31.820 --> 00:19:34.570
Yeah, tell 'em! Tell 'em!

00:19:34.570 --> 00:19:36.910
Magic isn't what we're all about!

00:19:34.570 --> 00:19:36.910
That's right!

00:19:36.910 --> 00:19:39.320
This isn't the way to go.

00:19:39.320 --> 00:19:42.620
We can never change
this school at this rate.

00:19:42.620 --> 00:19:47.670
We demand a forum to discuss wiping out
discrimination with the Student Council!

00:19:47.670 --> 00:19:49.460
On equal terms!

00:19:51.330 --> 00:19:55.040
OPEN FORUM BY THE STUDENT COUNCIL AND
A VOLUNTEER COALITION REGARDING THE
ELIMINATION OF DISCRIMINATION IN THE SCHOOL

00:19:51.960 --> 00:19:55.040
APRIL 23, 2095

00:19:57.510 --> 00:20:02.100
Kinoe Tsukasa. His family
hails from a line of <i>onmyoji</i>.

00:20:02.100 --> 00:20:06.770
But most crucial of all is the existence
of his brother-in-law, Hajime.

00:20:06.770 --> 00:20:11.570
Using Kinoe as his puppet, Hajime
Tsukasa had him enroll at First High.

00:20:11.570 --> 00:20:16.900
That man is the leader
of Blanche's Japanese branch.

00:20:16.900 --> 00:20:23.120
This coalition was formed by Kinoe
who's being manipulated by Hajime Tsukasa.

00:20:23.120 --> 00:20:27.040
They might try to provoke unrest
at tomorrow's debate.

00:20:28.920 --> 00:20:30.330
All right, I'm off.

00:20:30.330 --> 00:20:32.540
Leave security to us.

00:20:32.540 --> 00:20:34.210
Miyuki...

00:20:34.210 --> 00:20:36.170
Listen closely to what I have to say.

00:20:36.170 --> 00:20:37.380
Huh?

00:20:40.590 --> 00:20:46.680
Just as you pointed out, I won't deny
that discrimination does exist at this school.

00:20:46.680 --> 00:20:47.980
Despite efforts by the school,

00:20:47.980 --> 00:20:50.850
the Student Council and the
Disciplinary Committee to ban them,

00:20:50.850 --> 00:20:53.820
the terms so many students
continue to use...

00:20:53.820 --> 00:20:56.650
"Blooms" and "Weeds"...

00:20:56.650 --> 00:21:00.070
Course 1 students calling Course 2 students
"Weeds" and looking down on them...

00:21:00.070 --> 00:21:03.780
But among the Course 2 students are those who
resign themselves to that derogatory term,

00:21:03.780 --> 00:21:06.120
and learn to accept it.

00:21:06.120 --> 00:21:09.500
Such a lamentable
culture does exist here.

00:21:09.500 --> 00:21:12.670
The issue is this barrier to awareness.

00:21:12.670 --> 00:21:15.460
As this school's Student Council president,

00:21:15.460 --> 00:21:20.220
I would like to find a way to take down
this barrier to awareness.

00:21:20.220 --> 00:21:24.600
So that every student can enjoy
three invaluable years here.

00:21:24.600 --> 00:21:29.140
And so that this wish of mine can be
passed down to the next generation.

00:21:29.140 --> 00:21:30.770
I pray that it will.

00:21:36.230 --> 00:21:38.400
President Saegusa...

00:21:58.130 --> 00:22:00.050
Brother...

00:22:00.050 --> 00:22:01.630
I...

00:22:06.880 --> 00:22:08.720
"NATIONAL MAGIC 
UNIVERSITY AFFILIATED
FIRST HIGH SCHOOL"
